            <div xml:id="d731">

                <pb facs="0663" n="547" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg547"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.001/12.]</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the
                            Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-08-08">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 8, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>President Leconte was killed this morning in the destruction of the palace by
                    accidental explosion of magazines in which smokeless powder had recently been
                    stored. About one hundred killed. Congress will proceed to elect successor
                    to-day.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Furniss.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
